{% comment %}
Unless is the inverse of if — the block only runs when the condition is false. Useful when the "false" case is the primary path you want to read first, such as aborting a send when a condition isn't met.
{% endcomment %}

{% unless {{custom_attribute.${has_active_subscription}}} %}
    Renew your subscription to keep your benefits.
{% endunless %}

{% comment %}Commonly paired with abort_message to stop a send on the wrong day.{% endcomment %}
{% assign current_day_name = 'now' | date: '%a' %}
{% unless current_day_name == "Wed" %}
    {% abort_message('Wrong day of the week') %}
{% endunless %}
